					<br>
				</td>
				<td width="70%" class="body" valign="top">
					<table width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0">
					<tr>
						<td width="100%" class="body" valign="top">
														Hey thats a pretty good Idea, but generally I would find this pertain more to the lower level characters in our guild.  Perhaps, adding onto the bank idea, we could all put in some money for raids &amp; guild events.  We can give away prizes at the events, and maybe even a stack of food and beer so we can party.  I think if we had 30 drunk people all around eachother it would turn out to be quite fun, especially drunk dueling.  So maybe guild bank donations would be helpful too, take off restraint from Fay and Kandu and some of the officers as well.  It would be a guild effort not just a adminstration effort, that way making contributions feel important, but also lower level characters have not the resources as some of us advisors, so im sure it would all manage out.<br />
<br />
Archmage Advisor - Scandaltrik						</td>
